        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Madonna, Stuart Price\n- Products: \"Get Together\", \"Confessions on a Dance Floor\", \"I'm Going to Tell You a Secret\"\n- Companies: Warner Bros.\n- Places: Stuart Price's home studio\n\nFacts:\n- In 2005, \"Get Together\" was released as the third single from Madonna's tenth studio album \"Confessions on a Dance Floor\" by Warner Bros.\n- Madonna is an American singer, and \"Get Together\" is a song from her 2005 album \"Confessions on a Dance Floor\".\n- Madonna and Stuart Price produced the song \"Get Together\".\n- During work on \"Confessions on a Dance Floor\", Madonna continued her collaboration with Stuart Price, who was overseeing her documentary \"I'm Going to Tell You a Secret\".\n- \"Confessions on a Dance Floor\" was mainly recorded at Stuart Price's home studio, where Madonna spent most of her recording time.",
